


# ================================================================
# Strong PSAP misroute PRECURSOR discovery v2
# Detection-first / leakage-controlled
#
# Positive:
#   psap_routing_definite_misroutes_filtered_by_routed_distance.csv
#
# Negative:
#   matched DEFINITE_CORRECT calls
#
# Key principles:
#   1. Explicit PRE-ROUTE allow-list; do not start from old CAT/NUM feature lists.
#   2. No expected/routed PSAP, route result, ESInet, fallback, SIP answer,
#      call completion, or duration as predictors.
#   3. TAC/ECGI/IMSI/etc. numeric MEAN/MIN/MAX/SUM aggregates are blocked.
#   4. Useful text fields are parsed into compact semantic features.
#   5. Two nonlinear models + Mutual Information are used for stability.
# ================================================================

